Deskripsi:
Qualifications : 

 Minimum S1 Education 
 Minimum of 5 years of experience in Programming as evidenced by CV; 
 Master Back End Development programming (Java Spring Boot/PHP Laravel/C# .NET Core); 
 Master the back end (web service/micro service), Application Programming Interface (API) 
 Mastering Development Tools (IDE, postman/insomnia, git, etc.); 
 Understanding Relational Databases: Mysql, Postgree, Oracle; 
 Master Queue Tools (Optional): Rabbit MQ, etc; 
 At least 5 (five) different projects; 
 Able to work in an ongoing project (on going project).

